    "created_at": "2023-03-14T15:13:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-03-14T16:03:21Z",
    "body": "~The width and height in step 1 are the width and height of the image in image pixels.~ Edit: reading the spec again, step 1 applies density correction from EXIF, and gives a number in CSS pixels.\r\n\r\nMaybe there's a bug for the case where that is null, where the pixel density shouldn't be applied. Filed https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9023\r\n",
