    "created_at": "2023-05-17T13:16:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-05-17T13:16:37Z",
    "body": "Maybe step 2 in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#images-processing-model:preferred-density-corrected-dimensions should say \"physical dimensions\" (new term) instead of \"natural dimensions\" (or currently, \"intrinsic dimensions\"), defined as step 2 in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#preparing-an-image-for-presentation:preferred-density-corrected-dimensions\r\n\r\n> the width and height obtained from req's [image data](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#img-req-data), as defined by the relevant codec.",
